Payment DB

Engine:
  PostgreSQL

Tables:

  payments
    owns:
      payment state
      amount
      currency
      user_id

  payment_transactions
    owns:
      transaction state
      provider reference

Relations:

  payments.user_id -> users.id
  payment_transactions.payment_id -> payments.id

Read:
  payments
  payment_transactions

Write:
  payments
  payment_transactions

Note:
  Purpose: "Payment status səhv gəlir" kimi bir report gələndə AI birbaşa
  payment -> db.sdd -> payments -> status yolunu izləyir, bütün kodu
  scan etmək əvəzinə (prompt/new/9.md, point 5).
